  portraits:
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: cb0c139a2486cf641af0c4c170cff6e7, type: 3}
  - {fileID: 21300000, guid: cd2252702510e1b4283947f32e751599, type: 3}
  dialogueBoxImage: {fileID: 1301518215, guid: dfc348bf49832804086a1e00827d2ec2, type: 3}
  sentences:
  - "Ah, brave champion! You have returned\u2026"
  - and in your hands, the Earth Elemelon!
  - Never did I think I would lay eyes on its verdant glow again...
  - "Come! Let me place it back where it belongs\u2014in the throne room."
  - The soil shall once again breathe life into our lands.
  - The balance is one step closer to being restored.
  - You, my valiant friend, are the bearer of light
  - "in our kingdom\u2019s darkest hours."
  - "Now go, hero. The journey is not yet over\u2014"
  - but for this moment, let us bask in victory.
